1 c) Issue a writ in the nature of Mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, directing the respondent No.3 to promptly register an FIR against the owners of the camels directly violating the sections enshrined under the PCA through such illegal transportation;
